+    - `PUBSUB tcp 64B`: `3208.01 Kmsg/s` vs `2421.78 Kmsg/s`, `-24.51%`
+    - `PUBSUB inproc 64B`: `3818.17 Kmsg/s` vs `2222.58 Kmsg/s`, `-41.79%`
+  - rerun
